# Mirrors the root .dockerignore's safety bar - `COPY . .` below is
# recursive (sync/Dockerfile), so anything not excluded here silently ends
# up in the published image. None of these should ever exist in this
# directory in normal use (credentials live in docker-compose env vars, not
# files), but a stray local .env/.git from a misconfigured checkout
# shouldn't get baked into a public image if one ever does.
.git
.env
.env.local
.env*.local
